WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.069
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.070
We hope you're all
doing well tonight

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.671
and, now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.875
While visiting an elementary
school in New Jersey yesterday,

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.044
President Biden stopped
to help a student

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.012
pick up the pieces
of their block tower

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.447
after it had fallen over.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.349
Or, he tried to, but Joe Manchin
kept getting in the way.

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:18.784
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:21.253
President Biden spoke
at a campaign rally today

00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:24.290
for Virginia gubernatorial
candidate Terry McAuliffe.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.492
Though, I don't know how much
that's going to help.

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:29.061
That's kind of like seeing an ad
for Spirit Airlines

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:30.897
on the side of a Kia Sorento.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.565
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.135
According to new guidelines
from the Biden administration,

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:37.537
unvaccinated Americans
will have to present

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.006
a negative COVID test
from the previous day

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.374
before entering the country,

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:44.143
while vaccinated Americans
can present a negative test

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.845
from three days before travel.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.947
And people from Florida
will have to travel around

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.081
in one of these.

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:50.783
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:52.652
-Whoo!
-This is fascinating --

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:55.421
Tesla CEO Elon Musk's
net worth increased

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:58.190
by $36 billion yesterday.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.460
It's just a shame
that a good haircut

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.361
costs $37 billion.

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:03.929
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.432
-Whoo!
-The band Coldplay
announced recently

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.534
that their 2022
stadium world tour

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.269
will be partially powered

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:12.371
by a dance floor
that creates electricity

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:13.639
when people jump up and down.

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:17.209
Well, I'd also bring
a generator, to be safe.

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:18.945
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:22.348
I love Coldplay,
but who jumps up and down?

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:23.682
"They're playing
'The Scientist.'

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:25.018
Open up the mosh pit."

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.653
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:29.422
Organizers of the 2022
Winter Olympics in Beijing

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.957
have announced that unvaccinated
athletes and coaches

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:34.494
will be required to quarantine
for three weeks

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.863
to participate in the Games
because, eventually,

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:40.033
they're going to have to be
a lot less than six feet apart.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:45.004
A new study suggests
that long-term side effects

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.106
of the coronavirus
may include memory loss,

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:49.442
so, if you never got COVID,

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.710
maybe you did.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:55.014
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:58.617
A hiker in Colorado
was recently lost for 24 hours

00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:01.186
after they reportedly ignored
calls on their cellphone

00:02:01.186 --> 00:02:03.856
from rescuers because they
did not know the number.

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:05.024
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.426
To be fair,
it would be devastating

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:10.329
to use your last bit of phone
battery, only to find out

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:12.932
your car's extended warranty
has expired.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.067
[ Laughter, applause,
and cheering ]

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.770
And, finally,
New York Governor Kathy Hochul

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.473
yesterday encouraged commuters
to take precautions

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:23.776
over the next few days,

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:26.779
as part of the state
experiences severe weather.

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:29.048
But, just in case,
the MTA will be handing out

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.950
free floaties.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.252
And, you guys,
that was the monologue.

